    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3c2045fb07f7f0be8427e150dcdc12a79b50f58c9f6f00001aa7257053b6fa65",
      "request_id": "3c2045fb07f7f0be8427e150dcdc12a79b50f58c9f6f00001aa7257053b6fa65",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d7a588865badc8db4f7c8ec7a00c18b7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "首轮轮空后，他用七比五、六比三击败诺里，迈过这周的第一关。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "28960f5f315663ee6700bebe130218a354d763a0833753f6d9f555d0b6bf211f",
      "words_sha256": "a35e8d3bf725118f6e8ffdca3d66450cbb39ab85ff9ecdb3910b5061da703e2b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4e9bc6893609f621b91cdcfd897bc814b8b157c3bdfc7a2116a8ef78c7cec143",
      "request_id": "4e9bc6893609f621b91cdcfd897bc814b8b157c3bdfc7a2116a8ef78c7cec143",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "32263aa2ef953b018b6c1450c8036581",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "巴黎那一周，弗里茨握着两个赛点，最后却没能击败阿卡。一周之后，北京时间十一月十四日晚，他在斯德哥尔摩，赢得生涯首个室内冠军。这一周，他怎样走到这里？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3793e63d74805b41960979470297849e0c11ae0bbd9f37dacc3cf372b932c077",
      "words_sha256": "96f25fb004b5feb303a4e350e89c5fa496b65d6dc4250e3301c83ffd34bb01de"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:66a50e92586622de9cf147c3284d6bce9718e42927ba4ff2b899d07475f7a734",
      "request_id": "66a50e92586622de9cf147c3284d6bce9718e42927ba4ff2b899d07475f7a734",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d5fae489f0e83426b12d483167618e6e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "弗里茨制胜分二十二，蒂兰特三十五；非受迫失误二十一对三十六。这场决赛，你最记得哪一个关键分？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6644b73314a82581a00ee29ae4f28ac24b295aca114e4d6d946f892d7349c2f0",
      "words_sha256": "cf61e335848ae60099ea3552b2edf8260fbe8bb59bb37e0b4b486b4526648faf"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6aaa554b886bc14a8bd0cfe9fdd96eb25a8770466e16e870f604a2c1e2a9a30b",
      "request_id": "6aaa554b886bc14a8bd0cfe9fdd96eb25a8770466e16e870f604a2c1e2a9a30b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e41d1d3df8d41135ec691013b54d724c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛再遇穆塞蒂。六比四、六比二，弗里茨用两盘争到最后一场的门票。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8341380e6eb4e47eea7c5af4821b0e9c940991d5ce543e8e3036bde674e0c71b",
      "words_sha256": "1e3751b038e8f17dd63a4dd85e9f2f79f63e4125701ff15a22c146094d728cd3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6c31949a84a5cef79ccb69137ae5864370dd4ed71422b82f86f61aff6fcde8b8",
      "request_id": "6c31949a84a5cef79ccb69137ae5864370dd4ed71422b82f86f61aff6fcde8b8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "daac219762b72948c8e40f961ce3fe70",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五比四发球，蒂兰特来到盘点。弗里茨最后一拍反手下网，比赛进入决胜盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1d733de99296e0a0d047a3246eed22e94156593ebe4e77386151deddbcfae296",
      "words_sha256": "0b9c2e850db7d3aaaf2b4a17aa864c75a40c04661ca3401ab7a1b6724fc38a82"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8e2b51739158ddb39af759cd6932f9889db413c4bc7e7dc031b502d99782f1e6",
      "request_id": "8e2b51739158ddb39af759cd6932f9889db413c4bc7e7dc031b502d99782f1e6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d9a0ea604e9ae1b0016bc6f149623962",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这是他第十二座巡回赛单打冠军，也是继华盛顿之后的赛季第二冠。巴黎的遗憾之后，他用奖杯结束这一周。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5f89292dacc1c441d256c58b1ccb83aef5f69f77a21cc9b2d46badb41b3981af",
      "words_sha256": "8b097cd1296b14be048475823b90897df4b21f33ff0db7586496eb5d98c7a97c"
    },
